# Browser
# Deflecting Palm (CR 609.7a, 615.8): Bot2's Dragonhawk has exiled a Lightning Bolt and set up "At the beginning of your next
# end step, Dragonhawk deals 2 damage to each opponent ...". Bot1 Swords it into exile and then casts the Palm: the exiled
# Dragonhawk - no longer on the battlefield - is still a source to choose, since the waiting delayed ability names it.
# At Bot2's end step its 2 damage to Bot1 is prevented and the Palm deals 2 to Dragonhawk's controller, Bot2: 20 + 5 (Swords)
# - 2 = 23. Bot1 stays at 20.

